OL,3,ARussell Brand being sentenced for rape
OL,4,Aand sexual assault - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand is being sentenced for
OL,7,Frape and three counts of sexual
OL,8,Fassault, after being found guilty on
OL,9,FThursday
OL,11,FThe judge tells Brand he is a "sexual
OL,12,Fpredator", who told a "series of lies"
OL,14,FEarlier, one victim told the court she
OL,15,Fwas "in shock and turmoil... I didn't
OL,16,Fhave any respect for myself"
OL,18,FAnother victim said "Russell Brand is a
OL,19,Fsexual predator who has no remorse",
OL,20,Fwhile another said she "felt powerless
OL,21,Fin that moment"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
