OL,3,ARussell Brand being sentenced for rape
OL,4,Aand sexual assault - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe woman who Brand raped in 2009 told
OL,7,Fthe court she was "living with trauma",
OL,8,Fand feared she had contracted HIV
OL,10,FIn mitigation before sentencing,
OL,11,FBrand's lawyer said his client was "a
OL,12,Ffundamentally different person today"
OL,14,FBrand faced seven charges: three of
OL,15,Frape, three of sexual assault and one
OL,16,Fof attempted indecent assault. He was
OL,17,Ffound not guilty on three counts
OL,19,FHis crimes took place between 2004 and
OL,20,F2009, and related to four women. They
OL,21,Fare all entitled to lifelong anonymity
